---
import Button from './Button.astro';
---

<section class="emergency-hub">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="emergency-hub__content glass-emergency">
      <div class="emergency-hub__icon">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126zM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      
      <div class="emergency-hub__text">
        <h2>Jika Anda Menghadapi Krisis Hukum Mendadak</h2>
        <p>
          Jika Anda sedang menghadapi pemeriksaan mendadak atau situasi hukum kritis saat ini, 
          <strong>jangan mengisi formulir</strong>. Tekan tombol darurat sekarang juga.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a 
        href="https://wa.me/6285171605225?text=Halo%20Aurelius%20Law%20Office,%20saya%20sedang%20menghadapi%20krisis%20hukum%20mendadak." 
        class="btn btn-emergency pulse float-subtle"
        aria-label="Hubungi layanan darurat hukum 24/7"
      >
        Hubungi Darurat Sekarang
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .emergency-hub {
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .emergency-hub__content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-10);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .emergency-hub__icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-red-button);
  }

  .emergency-hub__icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .emergency-hub__text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 250px;
  }

  .emergency-hub__text h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-red-deep);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  html.dark-mode .emergency-hub__text h2 {
    color: var(--color-red-button);
  }

  .emergency-hub__text p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .emergency-hub__text strong {
    color: var(--color-red-wine);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  html.dark-mode .emergency-hub__text strong {
    color: var(--color-red-button);
  }

  .btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .emergency-hub__content {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .emergency-hub__icon {
      justify-self: center;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
